        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Something's not right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it this time? Is your illness acting up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is totally different from Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though our losses were significant, when we seized victory in Chernobog, we could see our enemies struggling and their accomplices fleeing for their lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But doesn't Lungmen feel like it's empty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It can't be, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come to think of it, this is supposed to be Paci Plaza, right? How come such a large mall with so many shops is completely empty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Plus, I took a look around, and there's nothing of value lying around! Everything's already been taken!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't Patriot prohibit that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what I was saying. You know, Mephisto doesn't care what we do, but that's not the point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I was going to say is that, it's like someone hid everything from us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's just your imagination. Lungmen can't do a thing against us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We suddenly appear from every nook and cranny all of a sudden, and hot damn, it'll be just like that time at Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time, we're not going to wreak havoc across the city, but take it over. It'll become our city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Know what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Paci Plaza is the closest base to the L.G.D. Headquarters. It'll be quick and convenient to supply it from here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard it when it was mentioned in the last briefing. Anything else?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All the Reunion forces around the city are to gather at the L.G.D. Headquarters, and then spread out to take over the entire city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "We know how the squads in this district have been deployed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what about the other districts? I know many squads are supposed to be making their way over here, but quite a few of them have gone missing without a trace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Missing... what do you mean by that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's really strange. Their comms were still connected, but there was no response from them. We don't have any way of contacting them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "And soon, no one will be able to contact you either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What! Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "From the window! They're outside the window!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
