    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it! Did she swing down from the roof and smash the windows?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fight! Get moving! We have them outnumbered - all we have to do is slaughter them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pass me the radio.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes ma'am!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up, L.G.D.! Pulverize Reunion along with their bunkers!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell? ! Paci Plaza is my family's property! How dare you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, li'l Miss, Reunion is still fighting back. We'll have to prioritize neutralizing them before we can think about...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you say?! You good for nothing\u2014!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "L.G.D.! Attack!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good grief... *sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try to be careful though. These are our peoples' assets after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "They didn't move that piano away, probably because it's too heavy. That alone is worth 1.8 million LMD. The li'l Miss was boasting to me about it, so try to be careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_wizard_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't get away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take cover! Quick! Hide behind that piano!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
