    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "They smashed through our cover! Relocate!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "1.8 million gone... just like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Comrades, comrades! Listen closely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've taken the Paci Plaza as our new base, and have set up our defenses. However, the L.G.D. suddenly attacked us from the roof! They're currently thinning out our ranks!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alert!! L.G.D.'s main force is in Paci Plaza! I repeat, Paci Plaza!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you done yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When did you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you've finished reporting, your mission is done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
