    },
    {
        "text": "The mission is to let all the Reunion forces in Lungmen know that we are here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be waiting for them, for them to chase after us and meet the L.G.D. in mortal combat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "L.G.D.! Continue firing! Don't stop!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
